            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For a consumer asphalt emulsion, yes, as long as you match the pail to the driveway. The 200 E-Z Stir suits most maintained driveways and the 532 Resurfacer suits rough ones. Results depend heavily on cleaning, crack repair and weather, so preparation matters more than the brand name once you are in this price tier."
